# Keeps src-tauri/models/ present in a fresh checkout.
#
# tauri-build's build.rs validates `bundle.resources: ["models/"]` (tauri.conf.json)
# on EVERY cargo build — including `cargo test`/`cargo check` — and errors with
# "resource path `models` doesn't exist" if the dir is missing. The actual model
# weights are gitignored and fetched + SHA-256-verified at build time by
# scripts/fetch-embed-model.mjs (beforeBuildCommand → `npm run fetch:model`).
# Do not delete this file.
